1. 准备工作目录 openeulerproject 并进入
mkdir ~/openeulerproject
cd openeulerproject

2. 拉取 yocto-poky yocto-meta-openembedded yocto-mata-openeuler 和 本仓库
git clone https://gitee.com/openeuler/yocto-poky.git
git clone https://gitee.com/openeuler/yocto-meta-openembedded.git
git clone https://gitee.com/openeuler/yocto-meta-openeuler.git
git clone https://github.com/Meqjn-Ousapva/meta-loongarch.git yocto-meta-loongarch

3. 切换分支
yocto-poky: checkout dev_kirkstone
yocto-meta-openembedded: checkout dev_kirkstone
yocto-meta-openeuler: checkout openEuler-25.03
yocto-meta-loongarch: checkout kirkstone-openeuler

4. 打patch: 利用 yocto-meta-loongarch/patches 打补丁，详见 yocto-meta-loongarch/patches/README.patches

5. 进入 yocto-poky 仓库运行 `source oe-init-build-env ../build`
会自动进入到  ~/openeulerproject/build 目录下

6. 利用 yocto-meta-loongarch/conf 下 bblayers.conf.sample local.conf.sample 修改 build/conf/bblayers.conf local.conf
可以直接复制，然后修改相关路径
bblayers.conf 修改相对简单
local.conf 中要修改以下内容
OPENEULER_SP_DIR = "<home-dir>/openeulerproject"
EXTERNAL_TOOLCHAIN_GCC:loongarch64 = "/path/to/loongarch/toolchain"

7. 在 build 目录下运行 `bitbake openeuler-image` 

## 注
部分包源码缺失，手动下载到 openeulerproject/<package-name> 路径中
比如 qemu_8.1.4 缺失
cd ~/openeulerproject/qemu && wget https://download.qemu.org/qemu-8.1.4.tar.xz
